{"seq":3,"slug":"large-scale-ddd","title":"大规模 DDD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics/large-scale-ddd","wordCount":647,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"大规模-ddd\">大规模 DDD</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当组织从几个团队增长到几十甚至上百个团队时，DDD 的实践方式需要相应升级。大规模 DDD 不再只是技术建模问题，而是组织架构、团队协作和治理机制的综合挑战。康威定律在这个尺度上的影响尤为突出——系统架构不可避免地反映组织沟通结构。</p>\n<p>大规模 DDD 的核心主题是：如何让多个团队在各自的限界上下文内高效自治，同时保证系统整体的一致性和可演进性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 组织层面&#10;        A[产品战略] --&gt; B[子域划分]&#10;        B --&gt; C[团队拓扑]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 架构层面&#10;        C --&gt; D[限界上下文]&#10;        D --&gt; E[上下文映射]&#10;        E --&gt; F[集成协议]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 治理层面&#10;        F --&gt; G[架构守护]&#10;        G --&gt; H[演进路线图]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 组织层面\n        A[产品战略] --&gt; B[子域划分]\n        B --&gt; C[团队拓扑]\n    end\n    subgraph 架构层面\n        C --&gt; D[限界上下文]\n        D --&gt; E[上下文映射]\n        E --&gt; F[集成协议]\n    end\n    subgraph 治理层面\n        F --&gt; G[架构守护]\n        G --&gt; H[演进路线图]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>小规模 DDD (1-3 个团队)</th>\n<th>大规模 DDD (10+ 个团队)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下文数量</td>\n<td>3-8 个</td>\n<td>20-100+ 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协调方式</td>\n<td>面对面沟通</td>\n<td>正式协议 + 平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射模式</td>\n<td>非正式约定</td>\n<td>文档化的契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一语言</td>\n<td>全公司统一</td>\n<td>上下文内统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构决策</td>\n<td>集中式</td>\n<td>联邦式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更管理</td>\n<td>口头协调</td>\n<td>变更审批流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"团队拓扑与上下文对齐\">团队拓扑与上下文对齐</h2><p>Team Topologies（团队拓扑）框架与 DDD 的结合，为大规模组织提供了团队结构设计方法。四种基本团队类型直接映射到 DDD 的角色。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type TeamType =&#10;  | &#39;stream_aligned&#39; // 流对齐团队：负责一个业务流的端到端交付&#10;  | &#39;platform&#39; // 平台团队：提供共享基础能力&#10;  | &#39;enabling&#39; // 赋能团队：帮助其他团队掌握新技术/方法&#10;  | &#39;complicated_subsystem&#39;; // 复杂子系统团队：管理需要专家知识的组件&#10;&#10;interface TeamContextMapping {&#10;  team: { name: string; type: TeamType; size: number };&#10;  ownedContexts: string[];&#10;  interactionMode: &#39;collaboration&#39; | &#39;x_as_a_service&#39; | &#39;facilitating&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const teamStructure: TeamContextMapping[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    team: { name: &#39;订单团队&#39;, type: &#39;stream_aligned&#39;, size: 7 },&#10;    ownedContexts: [&#39;订单上下文&#39;, &#39;履约上下文&#39;],&#10;    interactionMode: &#39;collaboration&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    team: { name: &#39;支付团队&#39;, type: &#39;stream_aligned&#39;, size: 6 },&#10;    ownedContexts: [&#39;支付上下文&#39;, &#39;结算上下文&#39;],&#10;    interactionMode: &#39;x_as_a_service&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    team: { name: &#39;推荐引擎团队&#39;, type: &#39;complicated_subsystem&#39;, size: 5 },&#10;    ownedContexts: [&#39;推荐上下文&#39;],&#10;    interactionMode: &#39;x_as_a_service&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    team: { name: &#39;开发者平台团队&#39;, type: &#39;platform&#39;, size: 8 },&#10;    ownedContexts: [&#39;认证上下文&#39;, &#39;监控上下文&#39;, &#39;API 网关上下文&#39;],&#10;    interactionMode: &#39;x_as_a_service&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    team: { name: &#39;DDD 教练组&#39;, type: &#39;enabling&#39;, size: 3 },&#10;    ownedContexts: [],&#10;    interactionMode: &#39;facilitating&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stream_aligned'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 流对齐团队：负责一个业务流的端到端交付</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'platform'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 平台团队：提供共享基础能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'enabling'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 赋能团队：帮助其他团队掌握新技术/方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'complicated_subsystem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 复杂子系统团队：管理需要专家知识的组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamContextMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  team</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ownedContexts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  interactionMode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'collaboration'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'x_as_a_service'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'facilitating'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> teamStructure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamContextMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    team: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stream_aligned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ownedContexts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'履约上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactionMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'collaboration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    team: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stream_aligned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ownedContexts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'结算上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactionMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x_as_a_service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    team: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'推荐引擎团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'complicated_subsystem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ownedContexts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'推荐上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactionMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x_as_a_service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    team: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开发者平台团队'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'platform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ownedContexts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'认证上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'监控上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'API 网关上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactionMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x_as_a_service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    team: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DDD 教练组'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'enabling'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ownedContexts: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactionMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'facilitating'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 流对齐团队&#10;        A[订单团队] --&gt; B[订单上下文]&#10;        C[支付团队] --&gt; D[支付上下文]&#10;        E[物流团队] --&gt; F[物流上下文]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台团队&#10;        G[平台团队] --&gt; H[认证上下文]&#10;        G --&gt; I[监控上下文]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 复杂子系统团队&#10;        J[推荐团队] --&gt; K[推荐上下文]&#10;    end&#10;    A -.-&gt;|API| D&#10;    A -.-&gt;|事件| F&#10;    A -.-&gt;|API| H\">graph TB\n    subgraph 流对齐团队\n        A[订单团队] --&gt; B[订单上下文]\n        C[支付团队] --&gt; D[支付上下文]\n        E[物流团队] --&gt; F[物流上下文]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台团队\n        G[平台团队] --&gt; H[认证上下文]\n        G --&gt; I[监控上下文]\n    end\n    subgraph 复杂子系统团队\n        J[推荐团队] --&gt; K[推荐上下文]\n    end\n    A -.-&gt;|API| D\n    A -.-&gt;|事件| F\n    A -.-&gt;|API| H</pre><h2 id=\"多团队协作模式\">多团队协作模式</h2><p>大规模 DDD 中，团队间的协作不能依赖非正式沟通，需要明确的交互模式和协议。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 协作模式一：内部开源 (Inner Source)&#10;// 上游团队维护核心，下游团队可提交 PR&#10;interface InnerSourceProtocol {&#10;  repository: string;&#10;  maintainers: string[];&#10;  contributionGuide: string;&#10;  prReviewSLA: string; // 例如 &quot;2 个工作日内&quot;&#10;  breakingChangePolicy: &#39;semver&#39; | &#39;deprecation_period&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 协作模式二：API 契约 (Contract-First)&#10;// 先定义接口契约，再各自实现&#10;interface ContractFirstProtocol {&#10;  contractFormat: &#39;openapi&#39; | &#39;protobuf&#39; | &#39;graphql&#39;;&#10;  contractRepository: string;&#10;  versioningStrategy: &#39;url_versioning&#39; | &#39;header_versioning&#39;;&#10;  breakingChangeWindow: string; // 例如 &quot;30 天弃用期&quot;&#10;  contractTestSuite: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 协作模式三：事件契约 (Event Contract)&#10;// 发布方定义事件 schema，消费方遵守&#10;interface EventContractProtocol {&#10;  schemaRegistry: string;&#10;  eventCatalog: string;&#10;  compatibilityMode: &#39;backward&#39; | &#39;forward&#39; | &#39;full&#39;;&#10;  evolutionPolicy: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 协作模式一：内部开源 (Inner Source)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上游团队维护核心，下游团队可提交 PR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InnerSourceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  repository</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maintainers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  contributionGuide</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prReviewSLA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 例如 \"2 个工作日内\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breakingChangePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'semver'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'deprecation_period'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"colo